# Pure SaaS: UI & Anti-Slop Audit

Audit the UI for visual quality, accessibility (WCAG 2.2 AA), responsiveness, and anti-slop compliance:

1. Run automated token scanner: `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs check-tokens DESIGN.md --source src`.
2. Inspect for the Top 12 AI Slop Patterns (`references/anti-slop-rules.md`).
3. Consult `references/code-audit.md` for static code inspection patterns and framework replacement ledger.
4. Verify WCAG 2.2 AA contrast ratios ($\ge 4.5:1$ body, $\ge 3.0:1$ secondary, 2px focus rings) (`references/accessibility.md`).
5. Format all findings using `Finding -> Evidence (file:line) -> Impact -> Fix` (`references/design-review.md`).
6. Record any unverified browser or screen-reader checks as `untested`. Do not modify files by default.

